{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂1の乃木坂ヲタク\nかりんの発音 上り坂↑\n伊藤かりん↑です(っｴ`o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/08/12/9864363/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回のブログで\n私のオフショットは？とたくさんの方に\n言っていただいたので\n掘り起こしてきました。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にこれくらいしか無い。。。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"青野九段が考案された「9マス将棋」を\n直々に教えていただきました☻！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/08/12/9864363/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"普通の将棋よりシンプルなので\n将棋が分からない方でも楽しめますし、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"将棋を知っている方でも\n思わぬ落とし穴があって\nすごく楽しめるかと思います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"遊び方ガイドも付いているので\n気軽に遊んでいただけます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"青野九段に教えていただいた時の模様が\n将棋連盟HPに載っていますので\nよろしければご覧ください＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"http://www.shogi.or.jp/topics/event/2016/08/469.html"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幻冬舎さんより8月25日に発売されます！\n是非是非みなさん遊んでください"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/08/12/9864363/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この夏は結構なんだかんだ\nプライベート充実☻"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/08/12/9864363/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スイカ(純奈ゆっちゃんてぃーちゃん)で\nお泊まりしたり花火行ったり。\nあ、花火はてぃーちゃん\n来れなかったんだけど(´｡･o･｡`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"家族でご飯食べに行ったり☻\nお姉さんとかき氷食べに行ったり☻"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ディズニー1回しか行けてないから\n行かなきゃやばいー(´｡･o･｡`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スイカで行こうって話してるから\n絶対行く(๑•̀‧̫•́๑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/08/12/9864363/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お知らせ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/08/12/9864363/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-- TV --"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎将棋フォーカス   NHK Eテレ\n毎週日曜 10:00～\n(再)毎週木曜 15:00～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"14日の放送は時間が変更されていて\n13:05～13:35です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今週は1分切れ負け将棋！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回は3月のライオンの監修もされている\n先崎九段にお越しいただきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/08/12/9864363/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-- 雑誌/新聞 --"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎将棋世界9月号 発売中"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今月号は飯島栄治七段に\nお越しいただきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"将棋のこともたくさん\n教えていただきましたが\nひきかくくんグッズもたくさん\n頂いてしまいました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/08/12/9864363/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/08/12/9864363/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"是非今月号もご覧ください～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/08/12/9864363/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎EX大衆 発売中"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・まあやとゆっちゃんと\n乃木坂メンバーの癖なんかを\n解説させていただいています！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これを読んでからライブを見ると\nより楽しめるかも"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/08/12/9864363/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・さゆりんご軍団の新連載が\nスタートしました～( ^ω^ )！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひたすらゆる～く妄想を話してます。(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎AKB新聞 8月19日発売"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一実さんと取材していただきました！\n乃木ヲタなら分かって当然！\n乃木坂クイズを答えました( ꒪⌓꒪)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は本当に乃木坂1の乃木坂ヲタクと\n言えるだけのヲタクなのか否か...！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひ紙面でお確かめください！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"か  り  ん  (っｴ`o)"}],"source":"archive"}